  450	// What an administrator sees in the universe: players fight each other and moons appear. A day of raids
  451	// that only pillage empty planets has no combat rounds, no debris and no moons, which reads as a dead
  452	// universe however many missions ran.
  453	//   LIFE_FIGHTS  at least this share of the day's battles has a defender and combat rounds
  454	//   LIFE_MOONS   a universe with this many battles in a day and no moon at all
