 4	 * North-star coverage: does the AI cohort use everything a human player has in the game?
 5	 * Reads the object catalogue, the mission types and the aspect tables from the host, so a new object, ship or
 6	 * mission is audited without an edit here. Prints one `GAP <kind> <name>: <detail>` line per thing no AI account
 7	 * uses, and `COVER <what>: <n>` lines for the totals. Run inside the app container:
 8	 *   php artisan tinker --execute='require "Modules/AI/scripts/coverage-audit.php";'
 9	 */
