  201	    /**
  202	     * The account's own objective, written so that it outlives this login. A person works towards the
  203	     * same rung for days, while a login that re-decides from scratch has intentions no longer than one
  204	     * session, so the goal the account already holds is re-affirmed with what it owns today and only an
  205	     * account whose goal was met or given up takes up the objective afresh. The live goals are read
  206	     * before they are written: which rung the account is on is the board's answer, not a second opinion
  207	     * formed here (architecture step 4, hysteresis).
  208	     */
  209	    private function holdGoal(AiProfile $profile): void
  210	    {
